   59 060016 211 140             DEF SVERP
   60 060020 233 140             DEF BLOCKP
   61 060022 333 140             DEF HIRESP
   62 060024 233 140             DEF BLOCKP      ! LINE:   five numeric parameters
   63 060026 233 140             DEF BLOCKP      ! REC:    five numeric parameters
