  100 060157             ! INIT -- reserve the v0.13a1 writable workspace at power-on.
  101 060157             !
  102 060157             ! WORKSZ = 5204 octal = 2692 decimal bytes.
  103 060157             ! UNBAS2 is used as SIMON85's private RAM-base pointer.
  104 060157             ! Non-power-on initialization leaves the already-reserved RAM intact.
  105 060157             ! ============================================================
  106 060157             
