 2103 065111             ! the existing direct CRT LRAST path using SPX/SPY -> PTX/PTY.
 2104 065111             !
 2105 065111             ! This avoids the old per-chord CONINT and, for normal f=1 vector output,
 2106 065111             ! avoids the redundant MOVE which LNDRAW performs before every DRAW.
