 3302 070533             ! PAINT RUNTIME -- v0.09l BIDIRECTIONAL INDEXED-LIST PAINT
 3303 070533             !
 3304 070533             !       PAINT x,y,f
 3305 070533             !
 3306 070533             ! The seed coordinate is mapped through ROM360 SCALE.  The mapped
 3307 070533             ! pixel coordinate is retained internally as a 16-bit X/Y pair.
 3308 070533             ! The HP-85 backend currently accepts only X=0..255, Y=0..191,
 3309 070533             ! but the PAINT work-stack and internal pixel interface are not
