 3311 070533             !
 3312 070533             ! Fill rule:
 3313 070533             !       determine the original seed bit (PSRC)
 3314 070533             !       derive target bit PTARG from f
 3315 070533             !       scanline-fill the connected 4-neighbour region
 3316 070533             !
 3317 070533             ! f=0 -> target bit 0
 3318 070533             ! f=1 -> target bit 1
 3319 070533             ! f=2 -> target bit NOT seed bit (toggle whole connected region)
