 3531 071247             
 3532 071247             ! ------------------------------------------------------------
 3533 071247             ! v0.09l: BIDIRECTIONAL INDEXED WORK-LIST FILL.
 3534 071247             !
 3535 071247             ! v0.09k physically proved the complete repeated indexed DOWN-list path,
 3536 071247             ! including branching, rejoining and stale-seed rejection.  v0.09l keeps
 3537 071247             ! that DOWN implementation unchanged and adds the symmetric indexed UP list.
 3538 071247             !
 3539 071247             ! For every successfully filled scanline:
 3540 071247             !
 3541 071247             !       1. scan logical row y-1 within [PLFT,PRGT] and queue every
 3542 071247             !          contiguous PSRC run on the DOWN list
 3543 071247             !       2. scan logical row y+1 within [PLFT,PRGT] and queue every
 3544 071247             !          contiguous PSRC run on the UP list
 3545 071247             !       3. return to the dispatcher
 3546 071247             !
 3547 071247             ! The dispatcher processes DOWN entries whenever available; if DOWN is
 3548 071247             ! empty it processes one UP entry.  Processing either direction may queue
 3549 071247             ! new entries in both lists, so filling ends only when BOTH counts are zero.
 3550 071247             !
 3551 071247             ! PDCNT / PUCNT are one-byte entry counts.  Push/pop always recompute:
 3552 071247             !
 3553 071247             !       address = UNBAS2 + PDSTK/PUSTK + (index * 4)
 3554 071247             !
 3555 071247             ! Each entry is four bytes: Xlo,Xhi,Ylo,Yhi.  PFSEED remains the proven
 3556 071247             ! one-row dynamic-span primitive.  PFKACT ensures stale duplicate entries
 3557 071247             ! do not propagate using old span state.
 3558 071247             ! ------------------------------------------------------------
 3559 071247             
 3560 071247 114 261 156 PINIT   LDMD R14,=UNBAS2
      071252 205 
 3561 071253             
 3562 071253             ! Empty both indexed directional lists.
 3563 071253             
 3564 071253 120 250 000         LDB R20,=0
 3565 071256 014 266 321         STBD R20,X14,PDCNT
      071261 001 
 3566 071262 266 322 001         STBD R20,X14,PUCNT
 3567 071265 266 323 001         STBD R20,X14,PFKACT
 3568 071270             
 3569 071270             ! Fill the original mapped seed row using the proven PFSEED primitive.
 3570 071270             
 3571 071270 316 143 163         JSB =PFSEED
Page   64                                                             
