 3580 071276             ! PFLLOP -- drain both indexed directional work lists.
 3581 071276             !
 3582 071276             ! DOWN is tried first.  When it is empty, one UP entry is tried.  Any
 3583 071276             ! successfully filled row may create fresh work in either direction, so
 3584 071276             ! every completed item returns here rather than draining one list in a
 3585 071276             ! separate phase.
 3586 071276             ! ============================================================
 3587 071276             
