 3689 071543             ! ============================================================
 3690 071543             ! PFSEED -- process exactly one seed in PXC/PYC.
 3691 071543             !
 3692 071543             ! This remains the hardware-proven one-row primitive:
 3693 071543             ! re-read row, reject stale seed, expand to the true row boundaries,
 3694 071543             ! fill/write one complete span, then return.  It deliberately performs
 3695 071543             ! NO neighbour scanning itself; v0.09l performs that in PFLINK.
 3696 071543             !
 3697 071543             ! PFKACT is set to 1 only after the seed has passed
