 5369 075736             ! for safely using the faster INCHR- entry point.
 5370 075736             !
 5371 075736             ! BASIC CRT OFF was verified on the physical HP-85 as:
 5372 075736             !
 5373 075736             !       CRT ON  -> CRTWRS = 0
 5374 075736             !       CRT OFF -> CRTWRS = 6
